          <!-- 2. YOUR ACCOUNT -->
          <h2>2. Your Account</h2>
          <p>You must be at least 16 years old to use the Service. You sign in via Google OAuth and are responsible for all activity under your account.</p>

          <!-- 3. WHAT YOU CAN DO -->
          <h2>3. What You Can Do</h2>
          <p>We grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the Service for your personal or internal business purposes during your subscription.</p>
          <p>You may <strong>not</strong>:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Reverse-engineer, copy, resell, or redistribute the Service;</li>
            <li>Use the Service to build a competing product;</li>
            <li>Circumvent security or rate limits;</li>
            <li>Upload illegal or infringing content;</li>
            <li>Use bots or scrapers (except through APIs we provide).</li>
          </ul>

          <!-- 4. YOUR CONTENT -->
          <h2>4. Your Content</h2>
          <p>You own everything you upload or create through the Service. We only use your content to operate the Service — we do not use it to train AI models.</p>
          <p>You are responsible for ensuring you have the rights to any content you upload.</p>

          <!-- 5. AI-GENERATED OUTPUT -->
          <h2>5. AI-Generated Output</h2>
          <p>The Service uses third-party AI models (from OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google) to generate content. You should know that:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Output may contain errors.</strong> You are responsible for reviewing it before use.</li>
            <li><strong>Output may not be unique.</strong> Similar prompts can produce similar results for different users.</li>
            <li><strong>You may use the output</strong> for any lawful purpose. We do not claim ownership of it.</li>
          </ul>

          <!-- 6. PAYMENT -->
          <h2>6. Payment and Cancellation</h2>
          <p>Paid plans are billed in advance and renew automatically. You can cancel anytime — cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period. No partial refunds. We will give at least 30 days' notice before any price increase.</p>

          <!-- 7. AVAILABILITY -->
          <h2>7. Availability</h2>
          <p>We aim to keep the Service available but cannot guarantee uninterrupted access. We may modify or discontinue features with reasonable notice.</p>

          <!-- 8. IP -->
          <h2>8. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>All rights in the Service — including software, design, branding, and documentation — belong to Verso. These Terms do not transfer any ownership to you.</p>

