          <!-- 10. LIABILITY -->
          <h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Verso is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages (including lost profits or data). Our total liability is limited to the fees you paid us in the 12 months before the claim, or €50, whichever is greater.</p>

          <!-- 11. INDEMNIFICATION -->
          <h2>11. Indemnification</h2>
          <p>You agree to indemnify and hold Verso harmless from any claims, damages, or expenses arising from your use of the Service, your content, or your violation of these Terms.</p>

          <!-- 12. TERMINATION -->
          <h2>12. Termination</h2>
          <p>You can stop using the Service and delete your account at any time. We may suspend or terminate your access if you violate these Terms. Upon termination, your data is handled in accordance with our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

          <!-- 13. GOVERNING LAW -->
          <h2>13. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of France. Disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Paris. If you are a consumer in the EU, your local consumer protection rights still apply.</p>

          <!-- 14. CHANGES -->
          <h2>14. Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these Terms and will notify you at least 30 days before material changes take effect. Continued use after that constitutes acceptance.</p>

          <!-- 15. CONTACT -->
          <h2>15. Contact</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Email:</strong> contact@get-verso.ai</li>
            <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://get-verso.ai">get-verso.ai</a></li>
          </ul>

          <hr />
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 italic">Verso AI is not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
